      "value": "This world features an example of this causing a problem:\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_544e7879-d870-42a2-9c7a-99eb95a8e62f\n\nBefore whatever came about to make this change, I was able to get away with using UI elements in the pixelated gameworld with point filtering; now, in world elements that are UI based, like the custom chat text and emoji bubbles, are fuzzy and appear aliased when viewed through the render texture game view.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
