      "value": "@{5d21c1a8154b187933d51a3e|full_name} Any specific reasons as to why enforcing a filter mode on UI specifically is a good thing? I would like to know what you mean by a \"good problem\".\n\nEspecially with this not being the default, it's something that explicitly must be done by the creator. Also sprite renderers don't have this issue, just UI canvases in the client.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
