      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5d21c1a8154b187933d51a3e|full_name} For those use cases I absolutely agree that it's a benefit to making a smoother experience in VR and Desktop. Although for our situation it makes our in-game text boxes really blurry and hard to read compared to the rest of the UI. See images for example.\n\nThanks for the info about the shader, we will look into a custom shader which doesn't automatically apply sampling over the UI.",
